<div style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <h2 style="color: #2e7d32;">Purchase Order Received</h2>
  <p>Good news — your purchase order has been received and your stock has been recharged.</p>
  <table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 16px 0;">
    <tr style="background: #f5f5f5;">
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><strong>PO Number</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;">{{ PoNumber }}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><strong>Product</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;">{{ ProductName }}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="background: #f5f5f5;">
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><strong>Barcode</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;">{{ Barcode }}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><strong>Quantity</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; color: #2e7d32; font-weight: bold;">{{ Quantity }}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p>No further action is required.</p>
  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 24px 0;" />
  <p style="color: #888; font-size: 12px;">This is an automated email from Wrapsfer.</p>
</div>
